    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SEATTLE\nSpokane\nEphratae\nMoses Lake\nRICHLAND\nYAKIMA\nVancouver - - ----\nKENNEWICK\n• PASCO\nWALLA\nWALLA\nPortland\nRoutes in Operation\nRoutes Proposed\nINLAND AIRWAYS\nServing the State af\nWashington with Dependable\nAirline Service",
